\section*{Integral \#1 (Hard)}
\[
I=\int_0^{\pi/2}\ln(\csc\theta)\sin^3\theta \;d\theta
\]
Solution Methodology:
\begin{itemize}
    \item Sub: $x=\cos\theta$
    \item Simplify
    \item Sub: $u=1+x$
